# `@media` At‑Rule

```css
@media (condition) {
  /* CSS rules */
}
```
The most common condition checks the viewport width:
```css
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .sidebar { display: block; }
}
```
You can also test height, resolution, orientation, and even user preferences like `prefers-color-scheme`.

slides.codeSnippet:
.nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .nav {
    flex-direction: row;
  }
}

