# More Specific Targeting

- `and` – all conditions must be true.
  ```css
  @media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199px) { ... }
  ```
- Comma (,) – acts like OR, any condition can be true.
  ```css
  @media (min-width: 768px), (orientation: landscape) { ... }
  ```
- `only` – hide from older browsers.
- `not` – negate the query.

# Beyond Width

- `height` / `min-height` / `max-height`
- `orientation`: `portrait` or `landscape`
- `resolution`: for high‑DPI screens
- `prefers-color-scheme`: `light` or `dark` (for dark mode)
- `prefers-reduced-motion`: `reduce` (accessibility)

```css
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  body { background: #111; color: #eee; }
}
```
